<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche Telekom.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Deutsche Telekom AG with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said believes stock's current valuation is fair but upside potential exists.</p>
<p>-- said that in a more competitive environment, &quot;the key to further outperformance lies in additional restructuring to boost earnings and cash flow growth.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said current management targets for reductions in workforce and other costs are conservative and may require revisions.</p>
<p>-- said investors could also &quot;hope to see considerable gains&quot; from a restructuring of real estate assets and the re-evaluation of capital expenditure programs.</p>
</text>
